OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for using teenagers to 
OL,4,Adistribute drugs                       
OL,6,FA man who used teenage boys to         
OL,7,Fdistribute drugs across Grimsby has    
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for six years and nine     
OL,9,Fmonths.                                
OL,11,FCameron Fitzgerald, 22, was arrested   
OL,12,Fafter a mobile telephone number linked 
OL,13,Fto him was discovered to have sent more
OL,14,Fthan 2,000 text messages offering      
OL,15,Fdrugs, Humberside Police said.         
OL,17,FOfficers arrested him in May and found 
OL,18,Fthat he had recruited three teenagers, 
OL,19,Fincluding one aged 16, to deliver the  
OL,20,Fdrugs, the force added.                
