OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for using teenagers to 
OL,4,Adistribute drugs                       
OL,6,FFitzgerald, of Windsor Road,           
OL,7,FCleethorpes, was sentenced at Grimsby  
OL,8,FCrown Court on Friday after admitting  
OL,9,Ftwo counts of supplying Class A drugs  
OL,10,Fat a previous hearing.                 
